tilt rho > 1 (tail certificate T < 0), but the lam = 0 endpoint
(iid) separates them again through the cross-block unions.
Whether any 2-block mixture defeats the full sweep, and at which
marginal cap killers first appear, is read off the J column.
Model-killers are NOT counterexamples to (S-coup): the block-
adaptive coupling of part D separates every product mixture with
some marginal < 1/2 once n log-dominates the mixing entropy.
What they kill is the single family-oblivious tilt parameter:
adaptivity to the mixture structure is then forced.
